WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:24.620
Tesla's power core packs a 7.4 megawatt solid-state transformer, inverter and breaker into one oil-free unit rated at 98.86% peak efficiency for 2027 operation. This is Tesla Shorts Time, episode 669. Waymo's freeway halt, a light software refresh, and Tesla energy's solar surplus follow, then counterpoint and first principles.

00:00:24.620 --> 00:00:32.960
PowerCore, Tesla Roddy reports, is rated at 9MV amperes of continuous output at 34.5KV AC,

00:00:33.660 --> 00:00:37.080
with grid forming support for 10MV amperes of peak power.

00:00:37.520 --> 00:00:43.920
That conversion holds across a DC range of 800-2000V, and a built-in solid-state breaker

00:00:43.920 --> 00:00:46.320
clears faults in about 100 microseconds.

00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:52.100
Tesla describes the hardware as Made in America and built for modular servicing, filling

00:00:52.100 --> 00:00:57.140
a gap left when MegaPak 3 and MegaBlock launched in September 2025.

00:00:58.080 --> 00:01:02.860
The device appears to group 4 MegaPak 3 units with a transformer and switch gear into

00:01:02.860 --> 00:01:04.620
a single medium voltage block.

00:01:05.280 --> 00:01:10.720
A typical battery or solar project today uses low voltage inverters to turn DC into AC,

00:01:11.280 --> 00:01:15.140
then a large oil-filled transformer to step that power up to grid voltage.

00:01:15.620 --> 00:01:20.540
While solid-state units handle both steps with power electronics, which means less equipment

00:01:20.540 --> 00:01:26.400
and a smaller footprint. Grid forming capability lets it actively hold voltage and frequency steady,

00:01:26.780 --> 00:01:31.520
rather than simply following the grid. As conventional transformer lead times have stretched

00:01:31.520 --> 00:01:36.800
into years, and copper coils and tanks of oil have barely changed since the 1890s,

00:01:37.180 --> 00:01:42.991
even as batteries, solar, and compute all run on DC. Waymo has pulled its driverless

00:01:42.991 --> 00:01:48.051
taxis from all US freeways while it evaluates performance. Inside EVs reports,

00:01:48.051 --> 00:01:52.931
after the California Department of Motor Vehicles, or DMV, barred them from

00:01:52.931 --> 00:01:55.771
state highways as an imminent hazard to public safety.

00:01:56.371 --> 00:02:00.611
The band followed multiple incidents in which Waymo vehicles entered active construction

00:02:00.611 --> 00:02:06.091
zones, went into effect last week, and does not apply beyond state borders, though the

00:02:06.091 --> 00:02:08.971
Alphabet-owned company extended the suspension nationwide.

00:02:09.611 --> 00:02:11.891
City Street ride hailing remains operational.

00:02:12.491 --> 00:02:17.011
This is the second time this year that Waymo, the biggest company in the robotaxi industry,

00:02:17.011 --> 00:02:23.831
has pulled its robot taxis from American highways, and in June it recalled 3,871 electric

00:02:23.831 --> 00:02:28.831
taxis using its fifth-generation automated driving system over concerns they could drive

00:02:28.831 --> 00:02:31.591
at highway speeds into lanes closed for construction.

00:02:32.211 --> 00:02:37.611
In a more recent incident unrelated to the ban, a driverless Waymo Jaguar eyepace was

00:02:37.611 --> 00:02:42.831
filmed trying to pass a California highway police traffic break on Interstate 280, while

00:02:42.831 --> 00:02:47.211
While human driven cars stayed behind a pair of patrol vehicles, so debris could be cleared.

00:02:47.991 --> 00:02:52.651
Waymo currently operates in 15 American cities and has been offering driverless rides

00:02:52.651 --> 00:02:57.531
on California highways since last November, and it said it is working with the California

00:02:57.531 --> 00:03:01.091
DMV and other state officials to resume freeway operations.

00:03:01.711 --> 00:03:09.371
Software version 2026.44.1, not a Tesla app reports, renames the vehicle's internal

00:03:09.371 --> 00:03:15.511
computer from AI computer to SI computer in system properties for Intel, AMD, and legacy

00:03:15.511 --> 00:03:17.371
Model S and Model X vehicles.

00:03:17.911 --> 00:03:22.571
The update adds a redesigned service menu split into maintenance and actions tabs,

00:03:22.991 --> 00:03:27.251
and charger pins now group together on the navigation map at normal zoom levels.

00:03:27.811 --> 00:03:32.651
Zooming out shows Tesla's charging network as a single number and pin, and zooming in

00:03:32.651 --> 00:03:34.971
reveals individual supercharger locations.

00:03:34.971 --> 00:03:40.531
The large vehicle visualization that showed tire pressures is now smaller, leaving more

00:03:40.531 --> 00:03:45.471
room for other controls, with maintenance displaying tire pressures, recommended maintenance

00:03:45.471 --> 00:03:51.691
and battery health, and actions holding car wash mode, wiper service mode, camera previews

00:03:51.691 --> 00:03:52.691
and headlight adjustments.

00:03:53.391 --> 00:03:59.211
Tesla's owner's manual switched to SI computer instead of FSD computer in October, following

00:03:59.211 --> 00:04:04.491
similar renaming across Tesla and SpaceX, and the property string does not alter compute

00:04:04.491 --> 00:04:10.231
allocation or model architecture, so owners on HW3 and later hardware still receive the

00:04:10.231 --> 00:04:16.311
same incremental FSD improvements. Security fixes are included, and the releases light compared

00:04:16.311 --> 00:04:22.274
with others as Tesla prepares for next month's holiday update. Customer solar systems deployed

00:04:22.274 --> 00:04:27.534
by Tesla Energy now generate more than twice the electricity that global operations consume each

00:04:27.534 --> 00:04:34.334
year. The company set on X. Texas now hosts Tesla's first megacharger, Tesla Roddy set on X

00:04:34.334 --> 00:04:36.314
to support semi-operations.

00:04:36.714 --> 00:04:41.154
A charging corridor for semi will continue to be built until it covers every logistics

00:04:41.154 --> 00:04:42.154
route in the country.

00:04:43.302 --> 00:04:48.102
TSLAMMING found a preconditioning button in the New Tesla app's code, with availability

00:04:48.102 --> 00:04:51.182
that depends on vehicle support and Tesla's rollout.

00:04:51.722 --> 00:04:56.542
Those features will not appear simply by updating the app, and the car itself has to support

00:04:56.542 --> 00:04:57.022
the button.

00:04:57.682 --> 00:05:04.142
Tesla and Hertz, law 360 reports, are being sued over EV tax credits connected to a 4.2

00:05:04.142 --> 00:05:10.822
billion-dollar fleet transaction. CyberCab vehicles have drawn eight crash reports, Neo-TO reports,

00:05:11.502 --> 00:05:17.642
split between ADS and ADAS categories. A Tesla solar roof job, Yahoo Auto's reports,

00:05:18.102 --> 00:05:23.862
arrived at a garage with a seemingly small issue that requires a total rebuild costing $5,600.

00:05:24.602 --> 00:05:31.142
A Tesla tuner, Tesla Rodi reports, is pleading to keep cyber truck production alive and has expressed

00:05:31.142 --> 00:05:37.842
interest in building a cyber SUV. The 2027 Tesla cyber truck, Kelly Blue Book Reports,

00:05:38.422 --> 00:05:46.402
will be offered solely in the Cyber Beast configuration at $112,235. Tesla is partnering with NVIDIA,

00:05:46.682 --> 00:05:52.282
Tesla North dot com reports, to apply the power core platform to AI data center power needs.

00:05:53.464 --> 00:05:58.184
T.S. Alamming argues the metric that matters for this kind of integrated architecture is real

00:05:58.184 --> 00:06:04.104
world efficiency from the medium voltage grid connection to the 800V DC bus, measured

00:06:04.104 --> 00:06:07.024
across load levels, and compared with a conventional setup.

00:06:07.664 --> 00:06:12.204
Fault recovery time would be a close second, because interrupting a fault quickly does

00:06:12.204 --> 00:06:15.404
not necessarily mean the system can recover just as fast.

00:06:16.306 --> 00:06:21.006
T.S. Alamming also said Crisco and Hot Rocket hardware would not be a great combination,

00:06:21.566 --> 00:06:25.986
and argued the best catch surface would need no lubrication or replacement after every

00:06:25.986 --> 00:06:29.006
catch, one less thing to maintain between flights.

00:06:29.646 --> 00:06:35.146
Tesla Roddy noted that once Robotaxi coverage becomes nationwide, owners will likely stop

00:06:35.146 --> 00:06:36.846
visiting service centers altogether.

00:06:37.506 --> 00:06:43.146
In Cloverdale, a new supercharger, not a Tesla app reports, adjusts output based on grid

00:06:43.146 --> 00:06:49.006
conditions through a PG&amp;E Flex Connect pilot, and can reduce power draw when needed, allowing

00:06:49.006 --> 00:06:51.166
earlier commissioning under utility rules.

00:06:51.166 --> 00:06:56.686
Tesla Roddy reports the SI computer label follows the administration's preference for the term

00:06:56.686 --> 00:07:03.626
superintelligence. Tesla's invite-only cybercab, Bloomberg reports, is built for Robotaxi fleets rather

00:07:03.626 --> 00:07:10.013
than individual buyers. Early cybercab buyers, tip ranks reports, are encountering uncertainty

00:07:10.013 --> 00:07:15.213
around home or destination charging because the two-seater design omits traditional ports in

00:07:15.213 --> 00:07:21.053
some configurations, weeks before the first scheduled deliveries in Austin. Tesla is advancing

00:07:21.053 --> 00:07:26.073
two lines at once, letting existing car owners connect vehicles to the network to make money

00:07:26.073 --> 00:07:29.493
while also selling dedicated driverless cars to individuals.

00:07:30.213 --> 00:07:34.933
Conditions for private cars to join the network, revenue sharing, and operation boundaries

00:07:34.933 --> 00:07:36.113
are almost all blank.

00:07:36.893 --> 00:07:40.913
Individual buyers have been informed that buying the car does not mean they can casually

00:07:40.913 --> 00:07:43.193
use it to run Robotaxi to make money.

00:07:44.218 --> 00:07:49.178
Heat, cost, and reliability are why solid state power electronics stayed in lower voltage

00:07:49.178 --> 00:07:52.598
niches instead of sitting on medium voltage grid connections.

00:07:53.198 --> 00:07:58.958
Moving the entire conversion chain onto silicon rather than copper coils and tanks of oil strips

00:07:58.958 --> 00:08:03.398
out a separate transformer layer and the real estate permitting and maintenance that layer

00:08:03.398 --> 00:08:04.278
drags with it.

00:08:05.218 --> 00:08:09.118
Conventional mega block architecture still carry that separate oil filled transformer

00:08:09.118 --> 00:08:09.918
and its losses.

00:08:10.678 --> 00:08:14.198
Tesla is targeting a 25-year warranty on this class of hardware.

00:08:14.198 --> 00:08:19.718
The operating range runs from minus 40 degrees Celsius to plus 55 degrees Celsius.

00:08:20.218 --> 00:08:24.778
Those two figures pull down the lifetime cost curve that kept solid state solutions out

00:08:24.778 --> 00:08:26.878
of utility scale deployments until now.

00:08:27.658 --> 00:08:32.478
For Tesla Energy, the product closes the loop between Megapack production and the downstream

00:08:32.478 --> 00:08:36.598
electrical balance of system that has historically been sourced from third parties.

00:08:37.218 --> 00:08:41.198
Capturing that margin while shortening project timelines is the cost advantage.

00:08:41.198 --> 00:08:44.698
At the same moment, AI-driven load growth is stacking up.

00:08:45.298 --> 00:08:49.938
The same hardware also lets Tesla sell into solar arrays and behind the meter storage,

00:08:50.298 --> 00:08:54.598
without asking customers to coordinate multiple vendors for the medium voltage interface.

00:08:55.624 --> 00:09:00.184
Before we go, next month's holiday software update is the larger release Tesla is lining

00:09:00.184 --> 00:09:01.484
up behind this light drop.

00:09:02.184 --> 00:09:04.244
That covers it for today's Tesla developments.

00:09:04.244 --> 00:09:11.804
